  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/ProcessoPortalValencia.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Process&oacute; i missa en honor al Xiquet Perdut,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/SoparPortalValencia.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>sopar de germanor amb assit&egrave;ncia de persones s&ograve;cies, autoritats, reines i representants d&#39;altres barris, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/DeCallePortalValencia.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>festa final amb el grup local &#39;De Calle&#39; a la cova de l&#39;Algepsar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5423.jpg\" alt=\"img_5423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5424.jpg\" alt=\"img_5424\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5426.jpg\" alt=\"img_5426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5427.jpg\" alt=\"img_5427\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5428.jpg\" alt=\"img_5428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5429.jpg\" alt=\"img_5429\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17provessosoparsocis/img_5430.jpg\" alt=\"img_5430